   828	\label{def:II-6-cartier}
   829	\source{hartshorne-algebraic-geometry:II.6}
   830	A Cartier divisor is a compatible collection of rational functions modulo units. It determines an
   831	invertible sheaf $\mathcal O_X(D)$; addition corresponds to tensor product and principal divisors give
